### TechShop E-commerce API Testing Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Register a new Customer account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TaiKhoan": "khachhang3",
  "MatKhau": "customer123",
  "TenKH": "Lê Văn C",
  "SDT": "0988776655",
  "Email": "levanc@gmail.com"
}


### 2. Login as Customer (Username or Email)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginIdentifier": "customer",
  "MatKhau": "customer123"
}

### Capture token from login response
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}


### 3. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginIdentifier": "admin",
  "MatKhau": "admin123"
}

### Capture token from admin login
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}


### 4. Fetch Products (Public - filters by search term, category and price range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=iPhone&categoryId=1&minPrice=10000000
Content-Type: application/json


### 5. Fetch Categories (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json


### 6. Fetch Cart (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 7. Add product to Cart (Requires Authentication - checks stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "MaSP": 1,
  "SoLuong": 1
}


### 8. Place an order (Deducts stock inside a database transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "DiaChiGiaoHang": "789 Đường Điện Biên Phủ, Quận Bình Thạnh, TP. HCM",
  "SDTNhanHang": "0988776655",
  "GhiChu": "Giao ngoài giờ hành chính."
}


### 9. View Customer Order History (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/history
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 10. Public Order Tracking (By phone number or order ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/track?phone=0988776655
Content-Type: application/json


### 11. Admin: View all orders (Requires Admin Role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 12. Admin: Update order status (If updated to 'Đã hủy', automatically restores stock in a transaction)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TrangThai": "Đã hủy"
}


### 13. Admin: Lock customer account (Lock toggle)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
